Third-Party Components

- LibVLC / VideoLAN.LibVLC.Windows (videolan.org)
  GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later. The app loads the unmodified libvlc libraries
  that ship next to it (dynamic linking); you can replace them with your own build of libvlc.
  Source code: code.videolan.org/videolan/vlc

- LibVLCSharp / LibVLCSharp.WPF (github.com/videolan/libvlcsharp)
  GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later.

- Online services contacted at runtime: Podnapisi and OpenSubtitles.com (subtitle search; OpenSubtitles needs
  your own key) and online movie/series information. Automatic subtitle download and online information are
  ON by default and send a cleaned-up title derived from the file name (TVmaze, iTunes, Wikipedia, Podnapisi, OpenSubtitles) and, for OpenSubtitles, a hash of the file; both can be switched off
  (Settings > Subtitles > subtitle settings, and View > side panel > online information).
